---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import KrillionArena from '../components/KrillionArena.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Krillion.si | Play Krillion Online - The Viral Reverse-Trivia Trench Game"
  description="Play Krillion online for free! Plunge into the ocean trench by guessing the rarest, least obvious answers. Features Daily Dive, Endless Practice, and 6 Themed Packs (Cinema, Geography, History, Sports, Science)."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative pt-12 pb-8 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Ambient Glow Background -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[350px] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-abyss-card border border-abyss-cyan/30 text-abyss-cyan text-xs font-bold tracking-wide shadow-md">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-abyss-cyan animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>SI PLATFORM • DAILY DIVE & THEMED VARIANTS LIVE</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-white max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-[1.1]">
        The Obscure Reverse-Trivia Game <br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-abyss-cyan via-blue-400 to-indigo-300">
          Where Common Answers Drown
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Anyone can name the famous answer. On <strong class="text-white">Krillion.si</strong>, you plunge deep into the hadal trench only by naming the valid, rarest answers that nobody else remembers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Game Arena Section with All Direct Modes -->
  <section id="game" class="pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <KrillionArena initialMode="daily" />
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: Game Variants & Modes Grid (Mirroring .org Full Breadth) -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-abyss-dark/60 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12 gap-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">Game Ecosystem</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1">More Ways to Dive</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1">Explore all official game variants, unlimited practice runs, and specialized subject vaults.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Variant 1: Daily Dive -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-abyss-cyan/40 transition-all">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-950/60 border border-cyan-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
              ⚡
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-abyss-cyan transition-colors">The Daily Dive</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Seven daily prompts, about 20 seconds each, synchronized globally at 00:00 UTC. One official attempt per day. Plunge as deep as possible and share your color-coded emoji grid with friends.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6">
            <a href="/daily" class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Play Today's Daily Dive</span> →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Variant 2: Endless Mode -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-abyss-cyan/40 transition-all md:translate-y-[-10px]">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-950/60 border border-indigo-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
              ♾️
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-abyss-cyan transition-colors">Endless Sinker Mode</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              No 24-hour lockout and no limits. Seven randomized prompts per run from an expansive question archive. Continuous practice to train your 7,000m obscure recall before playing the Daily challenge.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6">
            <a href="/endless" class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Launch Unlimited Practice</span> →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Variant 3: Themed Expansion Packs -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:border-abyss-cyan/40 transition-all">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-950/60 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
              🗂️
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-abyss-cyan transition-colors">Themed Category Packs</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Specialized domain packs for niche specialists: Cinema & Oscars, World Geography & Enclaves, Ancient Empires, Sports & Athletics, Language, and Physical Science.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6">
            <a href="#game" class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Explore Themed Packs Above</span> ↑
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: Rules & Depth Mechanics (The .org 4 Pillars) -->
  <section class="py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">Game Mechanics</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">How Does Krillion Work?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">
        Krillion reverses ordinary trivia. The faster you rush with the obvious crowd answer, the shallower you remain. Depth is determined by factual rarity.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5 space-y-3">
        <div class="font-mono text-3xl font-black text-abyss-cyan">20s</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">One Fast Decision</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          You have about 20 seconds to name one verifiable thing that satisfies the prompt before your air begins to deplete.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5 space-y-3">
        <div class="font-mono text-3xl font-black text-blue-400">🌊 Surface</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">The Obvious Crowd</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Common headline answers (0m–1,500m) keep you stranded near the sunlit surface with thousands of other players.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-amber-500/20 space-y-3">
        <div class="font-mono text-3xl font-black text-amber-400">3,000m</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-300">Too-Clever Trap</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Smart players cluster around standard textbook answers, causing a severe traffic jam in the twilight zone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 space-y-3">
        <div class="font-mono text-3xl font-black text-abyss-cyan">7,000m</div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-abyss-cyan">Hadal Abyss Crown 👑</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Valid obscure historical and scientific footnotes chosen by under 0.05% of divers take you to maximum depth.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: Strategic Field Guides (Full .org-style Library) -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-abyss-dark/40 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-8 gap-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan uppercase tracking-widest font-mono">Field Notes & Archives</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1">Tactical Guides for Trench Explorers</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Worked examples and recall frameworks to improve your answer selection before each dive.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/how-to-dive-7000m" class="text-xs font-bold text-abyss-cyan hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Read masterclass guide</span> →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="/how-to-dive-7000m" class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5 hover:border-abyss-cyan/40 transition-all group block">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-abyss-cyan mb-2">Core Strategy</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-abyss-cyan transition-colors mb-2">
            How to Reach 7,000m in Krillion: The Hadal Playbook
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-3">
            Master the second-tier pivot technique, scan categories effectively, and bypass obvious headline answers without losing the clock.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/too-clever-trap" class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5 hover:border-abyss-cyan/40 transition-all group block">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400 mb-2">Cognitive Psychology</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-abyss-cyan transition-colors mb-2">
            The "Too-Clever" Crowd Trap: Why 3,000m Jams Happen
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-3">
            Understand why clever answers (like Titus Andronicus or Madagascar) fail to reach the deep abyss due to consensus clustering.
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/7000m-words-list" class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5 hover:border-abyss-cyan/40 transition-all group block">
          <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 mb-2">Curated Cheat Sheet</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-abyss-cyan transition-colors mb-2">
            The 7,000m Words List: Rarest Answers by Category
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-3">
            A comprehensive study vault spanning Roman emperors, Pacific microstates, transition metals, and Shakespearean folios.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION: FAQ Accordion (Extracted from .org) -->
  <section class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Everything you need to know about reset times, scoring, and playing Krillion.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <details class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5">
        <summary class="font-bold text-white text-sm cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          <span>What is Krillion?</span>
          <span class="text-abyss-cyan font-mono">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Krillion is a browser-native reverse-trivia game where players dive into a deep ocean trench across seven open prompts. Unlike standard trivia games where the fast obvious answer wins, Krillion rewards factual rarity: the less common your answer is among other players, the deeper you plunge.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5">
        <summary class="font-bold text-white text-sm cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          <span>When does the official Krillion Daily Dive reset?</span>
          <span class="text-abyss-cyan font-mono">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          The official daily challenge resets globally every night at <strong>00:00 UTC (Midnight)</strong>. You can check our <a href="/when-does-krillion-reset" class="text-abyss-cyan underline">Live Reset Countdown</a> for your local timezone (8 PM EST, 5 PM PST, 8 AM CST).
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5">
        <summary class="font-bold text-white text-sm cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          <span>Can I play more than one game per day?</span>
          <span class="text-abyss-cyan font-mono">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Yes! While the official Daily Dive is limited to one attempt every 24 hours, you can play our unlimited <strong>Endless Sinker Mode</strong> or browse all <strong>Themed Packs</strong> with zero daily lockout.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-abyss-card border border-white/5">
        <summary class="font-bold text-white text-sm cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center">
          <span>How is my dive depth calculated?</span>
          <span class="text-abyss-cyan font-mono">+</span>
        </summary>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Every recognized valid answer lands in a rarity tier based on community response frequency logs. Points are converted to depth at 10 meters per point. A flawless 700-point performance sinks you to 7,000 meters at the bottom of the Hadal trench.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Partner Banner -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pb-12">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] p-4 text-center">
      <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-500 font-mono mb-2">Partner & Strategy Resources</div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs">
        <a href="https://krillionhints.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 font-bold underline">
          ⚡ KrillionHints.com: Full Daily Solver & Trench Hints
        </a>
        <span class="text-slate-600">•</span>
        <a href="https://krillionhints.com/one-in-a-krillion" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 font-semibold underline">
          👑 One in a Krillion: 7,000m Culture Explained
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
